          <div class="area-"><div class="view view-w4-cdsi view-id-w4_cdsi view-display-id-block_11 js-view-dom-id-0876851a42eaaf7779b8d54663b71d3016a17ecc45c96a43dc6db32ba82d5690">
  
    
      
      <div class="view-content">
        <h3>A.A. 2026/2027</h3>
    <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-title-1"><span class="field-content"><a href="/it/corsi/altre_offerte/aa-2026/2027/economia-aziendale-diritto-e-governance-dimpresa-classe-lm-77-r-immatricolati-aa-2026/2027" hreflang="it">Economia aziendale, diritto e governance d&#039;impresa (Classe LM-77 R)-immatricolati a.a. 2026/2027</a> [ABBof2 2027]</span></div></div>
